# Site links & anchor naming

Use **plain-language labels** that match what the visitor actually gets. Section `id` values must match heading slugs — see `.cursor/rules/anchor-links.mdc`.

## Kerry Muslim database (Microsoft Form)

| Use this label | Do not use |
|----------------|------------|
| Kerry Muslim database | Register, Register for programmes, Sign up (alone) |
| Join the database / Join the Kerry Muslim database | Register now (for the form) |

- **What it is:** Microsoft Form for a Kerry-wide Muslim contact database (salah timetables, masjid news by email).
- **What it is not:** Madrasa enrolment or weekly programme signup.
- **Canonical key:** `data-site-link="kerry-muslim-database"` — URL lives in `SITE_LINKS` in `scripts-*.js`.
- **Madrasa enrolment:** WhatsApp only (`madrasa.html#ready-to-enrol`, `data-site-link="madrasa-whatsapp"`).

