## Nav mega menu columns

1. **Browse programmes** — this week, programme guide, all programmes  
2. **Classes** — adult programmes, women’s weekly class, children’s madrasa  
3. **Listen & updates** — live audio & recordings, previous talks, Kerry Muslim database, Dhikr app  

## External URLs in JS

- Repeat off-site URLs once in `SITE_LINKS` (forms, Mixlr, GoFundMe, maps, WhatsApp madrasa).
- Masjid content APIs: `CLOUD_RUN_APIS` (Google Cloud Run, `europe-west1`).
- SumUp checkout only: `FIREBASE_FUNCTIONS.createCheckout` (Firebase Cloud Functions — **not** Cloud Run).

## Adding a new public link

1. Add entry to `SITE_LINKS` in `scripts-*.js`.
2. Use `data-site-link="<key>"` on HTML anchors (keep a full `href` fallback for no-JS).
3. Match label in nav and body copy; update section `id` if the heading changes.
4. Update `README.md` / `AGENTS.md` if it is a new third-party service.
